ftware-requirements/srd060-date.yaml (full SRD -- implement requirements R1.1 through R1.4)\n      - pkg/sys/sigpipe.go (SIGPIPE handler pattern used by all cmd/ utilities)\n      - pkg/testutils/difftest.go (DiffTest and RunDiffTests API for differential testing)\n      - CLAUDE.md (project build and test conventions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/date/main.go\n        action: create\n        note: date utility -- initial structure implementing srd060 R1.1-R1.4\n      - path: cmd/date/date_test.go\n        action: create\n        note: differential test scaffolding for date against gdate reference binary\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R1.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R1.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R1.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R1.4 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Call sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler() at the start of main per project convention for all cmd/ utilities\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Reference binary for differential testing is gdate (GNU date installed via Homebrew)\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Use exec.LookPath(\\\"gdate\\\") and t.Skip if not found, per project differential testing pattern\"\n      - id: D4\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in differential test environment per project convention\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"cmd/date/main.go compiles without errors: go vet ./cmd/date/... passes\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go build -o bin/date ./cmd/date/ produces a working binary\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Requirements R1.1 through R1.4 from srd060-date.yaml are fully implemented\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Differential tests covering R1.1-R1.4 functionality pass against gdate reference binary\"\n\n- index: 1\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/date: srd060 R2.1-R2.4\"\n  dependency: 0\n  description: |\n    deliverable_type: code\n\n    required_reading:\n      - docs/specs/software-requirements/srd060-date.yaml (full SRD -- implement requirements R2.1 through R2.4)\n      - cmd/date/main.go (existing implementation from prior task -- extend with R2 group)\n      - cmd/date/date_test.go (existing differential tests -- add tests for R2 group)\n      - CLAUDE.md (project build and test conventions)\n\n    files:\n      - path: cmd/date/main.go\n        action: modify\n        note: extend date utility with srd060 R2.1-R2.4 functionality\n      - path: cmd/date/date_test.go\n        action: modify\n        note: add differential tests covering R2.1-R2.4\n\n    requirements:\n      - id: R1\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R2.1 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R2\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R2.2 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R3\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R2.3 as specified in the SRD\"\n      - id: R4\n        text: \"Implement srd060-date requirement R2.4 as specified in the SRD\"\n\n    design_decisions:\n      - id: D1\n        text: \"Extend the existing main.go structure -- do not reorganize or refactor code from prior tasks\"\n      - id: D2\n        text: \"Add new DiffTest entries to the existing tests slice in date_test.go\"\n      - id: D3\n        text: \"Set LC_ALL=C in all new differential test entries\"\n\n    acceptance_criteria:\n      - id: AC1\n        text: \"go vet ./cmd/date/... passes with no errors\"\n      - id: AC2\n        text: \"go build -o bin/date ./cmd/date/ succeeds\"\n      - id: AC3\n        text: \"Requirements R2.1 through R2.4 from srd060-date.yaml are fully implemented\"\n      - id: AC4\n        text: \"Differential tests covering R2.1-R2.4 functionality pass against gdate reference binary\"\n\n- index: 2\n  title: \"[stitch] cmd/date: srd060 